\newlabel{fig:calutility}{{4}{14}{Probability quality and hypothetical decision utility of the seed-44 ensembles. (A--C) Reliability diagrams use five equal-count ensemble-probability rank groups, each containing 35 patients; these differ from the ten fixed probability bins used for ECE. (D--F) Net-benefit curves for generic threshold-based positive actions with treat-all and treat-none references. Scores are five-fold mean probabilities without recalibration. No specific escalation or de-escalation strategy is validated}{figure.4}{}}
